file "mos_levels.sp" deck
  title "mos_levels"
  comment " oracle: inpdomod.c nmos/pmos switch (levels 0 and 1 Mos1, 2, 3, 4 BSIM1, 5 BSIM2, 6, 9, 8 and 49 BSIM3), inpfindl.c (level is (int)(value+0.5): 4.9e1 is 49, -1 is 0), b3set.c:84 (a silent BSIM3 version is 3.3.0), run: level=-1 runs level 1"
